{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf6iF5VBDoz91Fehuhbt1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Let me verify the test count breakdown:\n\n**Command:** `./mvnw clean test` from sample-service directory\n\n**Result:**\n- OrderControllerTest: 10 tests (originally 4, added 6 new)\n- ShipmentControllerTest: 7 tests (originally 5, added 2 new)\n- SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test (unchanged)\n- CustomerControllerTest: 3 tests (unchanged)\n- **Total: 21 tests, all passing**\n\n**Failures:** None\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — All 21 tests pass, BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — Original 13 tests (4 + 1 + 5 + 3) all still pass\n3. ✅ **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels active order** — Test `cancel_active_order_succeeds_and_returns_200_with_CANCELLED_status` validates this\n4. ✅ **Persists it and cancels CREATED shipments** — Test `cancel_order_cancels_all_CREATED_shipments` validates both persistence and shipment cancellation\n5. ✅ **Error responses consistent with API** — Uses ResourceNotFoundException (404) and ConflictException (409) like existing endpoints\n6. ✅ **Repeated cancel succeeds** — Test `cancel_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_idempotent` validates idempotency\n7. ✅ **Cancel blocked by CONFIRMED shipment changes nothing** — Test `cancel_order_with_confirmed_shipment_fails_with_409_and_no_changes` validates this\n8. ✅ **Unknown order returns 404** — Test `cancel_nonexistent_order_returns_404` validates this\n9. ✅ **Shipment for cancelled order rejected** — Test `rejects_creating_shipment_for_cancelled_order_with_409` validates this\n10. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — Only used existing dependencies\n11. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified order, shipment, and api packages\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** — Added OrderStatus enum and status field (required, no alternatives)\n2. **OrderController.kt** — Added cancel endpoint and shipment repository injection (required for functionality)\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** — Added findByOrderId method (required to find shipments for order)\n4. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added order existence/status check on create (required by specification)\n5. **ApiError.kt** — Added ORDER_CANCELLED and SHIPMENT_CONFIRMED_CONFLICT error codes (required for error contract)\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** — Added 6 new tests and shipment repository injection (required for test coverage)\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 2 new tests and order repository setup (required for test coverage)\n\nAll changes are necessary and scoped correctly. No formatting changes, no unrelated refactoring.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint to cancel ACTIVE orders to CANCELLED status, cancelling CREATED shipments, with idempotent retry support and conflict detection for CONFIRMED shipments.\n\nChanged       Order.kt added OrderStatus enum and status field to track order lifecycle\n              OrderController.kt added cancel endpoint with CONFIRMED shipment conflict detection and idempotent handling\n              ShipmentRepository.kt added findByOrderId method to locate shipments for order\n              ShipmentController.kt added order existence and cancellation status checks on shipment creation\n              ApiError.kt added ORDER_CANCELLED and SHIPMENT_CONFIRMED_CONFLICT error codes\n              OrderControllerTest.kt added 6 tests: new order status, active cancel, idempotent cancel, 404 for missing, 409 for confirmed conflict, verified shipment cancellation\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt added 2 tests: 404 for missing order, 409 for cancelled order, plus setup of required order repository\n\nTests         newly created order has ACTIVE status — validates default status initialization\n              cancel active order succeeds — validates cancel endpoint returns 200 with CANCELLED status\n              cancel already cancelled order succeeds (idempotent) — validates retry safety\n              cancel nonexistent order returns 404 — validates missing order handling\n              cancel order with confirmed shipment fails with 409 — validates conflict detection and no changes\n              cancel order cancels all CREATED shipments — validates transactional shipment updates\n              rejects creating shipment for non-existent order — validates existing order lookup (baseline)\n              rejects creating shipment for cancelled order — validates new order status check (409 ORDER_CANCELLED)\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw clean test from sample-service directory\n              Result: 21 tests run (10 OrderControllerTest + 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests + 7 ShipmentControllerTest + 3 CustomerControllerTest)\n              All tests passed, BUILD SUCCESS\n              Failures: None\n\nNot done      None - all acceptance criteria implemented and verified\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1691,"cache_read_input_tokens":39398,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1691},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f31690e-0e42-46f8-a0d3-0316bcd8e8e5","uuid":"ed3061eb-cebe-41ab-9854-d4a2f00006a0","timestamp":"2026-09-16T07:19:30.397Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6iF4aMrsCT2hTuroGtH"}
